		{"id":"87b9f879268ada78","type":"text","text":"His hobby is toying with adventures - Mostly adventure's ","x":-566,"y":-2298,"width":304,"height":231,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"56fc44fec521fcd3","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":6,"y":-3200,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"#ffdd00"},
		{"id":"297eb27db6ef53e7","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":-539,"y":-2472,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2c587b94d2535a66","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Pyre 'Sol'.png","x":-620,"y":-3315,"width":235,"height":280,"color":"#ffdd00"},
		{"id":"af727f8cd065ec63","type":"text","text":"Was born in Zekiele but grew up in Jiothal\n\nReal name is Pyre\n\n\"Pyre Feur- oh sorry, should I call you Sol? Because you are too AFRAID to see the world as it is? You and your fake vigilante justice- too afraid to embrace love and kindness? Your father was _**right.**_\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nScared of spiders\n\nRealised  [[Conirutato, Demon Lord of Conspiracy.png]] from his capture by breaking Renthiel Shardcaller pendant\n\nInvari now owns him soul","x":474,"y":-3340,"width":491,"height":331,"color":"#ffdd00"},
		{"id":"7b6c98cc93c2511c","type":"text","text":"Death","x":-3745,"y":-3445,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"483d53f0f3a82f16","type":"text","text":"Dead Companions","x":-4640,"y":-3895,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"84383d8cecd3ad07","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Logi.jpg","x":-3760,"y":-4075,"width":280,"height":429,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"12bfd169e6dcd3a2","type":"text","text":"Fey're is apart of a small community within Akweriath\n\nShe was raised in the cloister of Histolarin\n\nWhat the Crimson Legion said: \"Fey're... Are you self-conscious- worried about your vampiric form? Or is it your mentor, oh what was his name? _**MEKAZZAK**_. It would be a shame if something _happened_....\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nFey're speech against Tal'krizzar - [[Fey're Speech]]\n\nFey're is a dhampir and Mekazzak's disciple\n\nFey're real father is a Baron within Akweriath","x":1681,"y":-2562,"width":491,"height":418,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"930277c693464113","type":"text","text":"Death","x":-3744,"y":-2640,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"a1658ac7a400b4cc","type":"text","text":"Died by drowning along side his dragon Vainyr","x":-3139,"y":-3445,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"3df686f55270ba9b","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Perditus.png","x":-3723,"y":-3191,"width":207,"height":400},
		{"id":"3c5f5c8406a85610","type":"text","text":"Cause of death - Unknown","x":-3138,"y":-2640,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"5f5ba37d189ed346","type":"text","text":"Imploded","x":-3138,"y":-2480,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"15fd5fe930045ec0","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":-3111,"y":-3021,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ce6c2d46c8924e4f","type":"text","text":"Is an Aeon == HellKnight == Good\nAeons sent Perditus on a mission to look into the ruin on the Solar Isles\n\nWorships: Nihil\n\nWhat the Crimson Legion said: \"Perditus Malleator, I must ask did you enjoy watching that church _**BURN**_ by your own hand?\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nPerditus was a criminal before joining the HellKnights\n\nPerditus is a mass murderer attempting to repent for his sins\n\nHad me deliver a folder to the HQ of the hell knights\n\nAfter the fight with the assassins at the gala, Perditus grew back a crimson arm, later he died. Perhaps because of it","x":-2643,"y":-3200,"width":491,"height":418},
		{"id":"867a8872581e20b0","type":"text","text":" A vaguely humanoid shape made of blood and muscle\n And the entire room is COATED in blood\n And the mirror is smashed and crackles with a red electricity","x":-2760,"y":-2685,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"#070647"},
		{"id":"14c1d6fb69771bcf","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":-3139,"y":-3890,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cffb7479800edb2f","type":"text","text":"Logi is apart of the Order of Scales who are situated in Astelrath\n\nWhat the Crimson Legion said: \"Logi and Vainyr, defeated by the PLAGUARI? They and Zoris were _**WEAK**_ compared to us and you failed. It was your fault after all, and you still cannot find that egg you HOLD SO _**DEAR**_.\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]","x":-2680,"y":-4069,"width":491,"height":418,"color":"2"},
