		{"id":"1d1df39298b4cbee","type":"text","text":"Zoranna is Sylvia's deity ","x":-423,"y":-707,"width":346,"height":123},
		{"id":"b18f349773bec25a","type":"text","text":"Zoranna","x":-319,"y":-450,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"39f673ebe37b76e6","type":"text","text":"Mercenary Guild what is a front for another organisation called the Black Moon what is an assassins guild\n\nThe Black Moons will plan on killing Sylvia when they get the chance\n\nArlina 'Dark Kiss' Korrin \nJaxen 'Wraith Cleaver' Vorn \nSelka 'Silent Siren' Malrix","x":1296,"y":3,"width":556,"height":263,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"161da65c7061b045","type":"text","text":"Sylvia's second mother is some form of devil","x":1296,"y":-780,"width":556,"height":263,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"982a3fa9f14ce9ef","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":-620,"y":-454,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"50f049dd3b75b703","type":"text","text":"Sylvia comes from Var'vel\n\nSylvia does not wish to go back to her home town\n\nIs apart of a big organisation - Named Hidden Promise\n\nSylvia was hired by Invari to be her body guard\n\nCould be the assassin - kills creatures/ people the same way the assassin does\n\nBroke of her agreement with Invari (Invari does not like Sylvia anymore, nor does Slyvia lie Invari) - They are friend again\n\nPart Fiend (Now has a tail)\n\nSylvia was the assassin but left the organisation so that she would get in contact with her mother\n\nWhat the Crimson Legion Said: \"What is this? Sylvia Valesong the _Blackmoon Assassin_! And you brought friends~... You're all going to die here\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nDating Detective Ashwin\n\n","x":3132,"y":-475,"width":491,"height":496,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"2cf6fbb7a6670c59","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Detective Ashwen.png","x":169,"y":-236,"width":325,"height":400,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"2547016f873407c3","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Asher.png","x":798,"y":-1637,"width":195,"height":130},
		{"id":"377218332c50f898","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Avatar of Fire.png","x":-620,"y":-1493,"width":400,"height":367,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"890859da28210259","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Bryyair.png","x":404,"y":-1507,"width":209,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"66c463b158c0c03c","type":"text","text":"Bryyair is an extremist he is even considered extreme for his people\n\nDoes not understand 'manlings' and why they live like they do\n\nThe world tree asked him to find a specific Ran'tal city\n\nWhat the Crimson Legion Said: \"Bryyair of Ashenbark, wasn't it worth it watching your grove be destroyed? All because you took in those whom you believed deserved it. Surely it was all worth it watching your grove burn because of _**YOU**_\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nBryyairs original grove was destoryed by 'malings' after he invited them in out of kindness\n\nBryyair is the [[Wyrm Speaker]]\n\nBryyair is a protector of the groves - [[Groves Infomation]]","x":1484,"y":-1516,"width":491,"height":418,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8b654bd60f642887","type":"text","text":"Notes","x":1025,"y":-1337,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
