		{"id":"94f666cd35e793ee","type":"text","text":"Invari comes from Antreath\n\nShe owns an organisation - Barred Association Regional Assistance Korinthan Organized Syndicate - Merchant guild name\n\nPossibly apart of Barakos crime family - No proof of this - If she is apart of Barakos she is either in charge or very high ranking - Her organisation names spells out Barakos - Later learned that she is the leader of Barakos\n\nInvari has a daughter\n\nHas a contract with three devils and Lillith == Warlock Patron \n\nWhat the Crimson Legion Said: \"Invari Barakos, your goals are so noble, but I must ask. How far does your criminal empire _**REACH**_\" - [[Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator.png]]\n\nOwns Pyres soul","x":2105,"y":723,"width":491,"height":418,"color":"1"},
